        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-11-10T21:09:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Zembar\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/z/779978/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Zembar:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Rabit wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Yeah, but the detrimental effects of carrying shards is cumulative...</blockquote></div>\nAre you sure of that?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I know that's what Christopher told me during playtesting, so yeah, I'm pretty sure of it.</p>\n<p>Someone&nbsp;official might contradict me, though. It's happened before.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
