        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/4af34b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-25T20:26:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, thinking it over, I was just going to post that having Dare go first, since he can reach the extraction point slightly faster and not face unified opposition early on, will make up for his 3-4 less hit points.</p>",
        "post_number": 29,
        "post_type": 1,
