        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/4af34b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-30T21:06:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We'll try it.</p><p>But... to repeat one question above, does the -2 move from a shard go away as soon as the holder drops the shard? Or is permanent for the entire turn once it kicks in at the beginning of the turn?</p>",
